 "en": {
  "Hello and welcome to Fnac Jeanne d'Arc! Tell me what you're looking for and I'll show you the section on the map.": "en/abc347b17d70.m4a",
  "Sure, let's continue in English. What are you looking for?": "en/3539665560fd.m4a",
  "Hello! What product are you looking for?": "en/bfb7a3f38201.m4a",
  "You're welcome! Enjoy your visit to Fnac.": "en/e39a21600fdd.m4a",
  "Of course. Tap “Call a staff member” and someone from the team will come to help you.": "en/d5729c527d9e.m4a",
  "I couldn't find that product. Try another word, or call a staff member who will come and help you.": "en/14db4a44331f.m4a",
  "Books, comics, school books, stationery, CDs, vinyl records and DVDs are at Fnac Wilson, 16 allées Franklin-Roosevelt, near Jean-Jaurès. Here at Fnac Jeanne d'Arc, we specialise in technology.": "en/e79836c852c9.m4a",
  "LEGO, POP figures and Pokémon cards are in the staircase between floor 0 and the basement.": "en/a6c4ccb90f67.m4a",
  "The entrance and exit are on floor 0, at the bottom of the map.": "en/9245b8ea7fd1.m4a",
  "The microphone isn't available on this device. You can type your question.": "en/82541228ecf4.m4a",
  "The microphone is blocked. Allow it in the browser, or type your question.": "en/152b5071baec.m4a",
  "I didn't quite catch that. Try again, or type your question.": "en/b240990acbf6.m4a",
  "The store is open Monday to Saturday, from 10 am to 7.30 pm. We are closed on Sundays.": "en/4320da14477d.m4a",
  "I'm sorry, there are no toilets in this store.": "en/fde07c666f29.m4a",
  "We don't sell large appliances here. In the small appliances aisle, the largest item is the cordless stick vacuum.": "en/790eb4376aee.m4a",
  "Yes, there is a lift for anyone who needs it. Tap “Call a staff member” and a member of the team will take you there.": "en/937b7322ea7d.m4a",
  "The store has no car park. You'll need to park in the neighbourhood.": "en/a6d2ab4156c7.m4a",
  "What kind? Headphones for music, a gaming headset, a VR headset, or a bike and scooter helmet?": "en/fef65658bc15.m4a",
  "A charger for which device? An Android phone, an iPhone or Apple product, a laptop, or a scooter?": "en/8a2bab73e794.m4a",
  "Which cable? For a phone, for an iPhone, an HDMI, USB or network cable for a computer or TV, or an audio cable?": "en/b2a7f5cbf601.m4a",
  "Which screen? A computer monitor, a TV, or a phone screen protector?": "en/339da2a41e74.m4a",
  "Which watch? An Apple Watch, or another smartwatch like Samsung or Garmin?": "en/e92ed9ea8cf7.m4a",
  "Which tablet? An iPad, an Android tablet like Samsung, or an e-reader for books?": "en/04cb8fdb1038.m4a",
  "Which computer? A Windows PC, a Mac, or a gaming PC?": "en/80697b7d2db4.m4a",
  "A keyboard for what? For a computer, or for an iPad?": "en/b756a445bcce.m4a",
  "A case for which device? An iPhone, an Android phone, or a tablet?": "en/a7db7b9f2926.m4a",
  "What kind of game? A video game, a board game, or trading cards like Pokémon?": "en/4bb62937719d.m4a",
  "Which battery? A phone power bank, AA-type batteries, a laptop, camera or scooter battery?": "en/db75d87e79fc.m4a",
  "Which speaker? A Bluetooth or hi-fi speaker for music, or a smart speaker with a voice assistant like Alexa?": "en/d48503522d77.m4a",
  "Which microphone? For filming or podcasts, for gaming or streaming, or for karaoke?": "en/c49395badb66.m4a",
  "Which adapter? A travel plug adapter, an HDMI or USB adapter, an audio jack adapter, or for an iPhone?": "en/13e8310b4a60.m4a",
  "Which vacuum? A cordless stick or robot vacuum, or a cylinder, Dyson or steam cleaner?": "en/ef5d4e4330c5.m4a",
  "Which coffee machine? A capsule machine like Nespresso, a bean-to-cup or espresso machine, or a filter coffee maker?": "en/cb1dcf74b353.m4a",
  "Which Sony product? A TV, headphones or a speaker, a PlayStation, or a camera?": "en/2261e3fcb8c9.m4a",
  "Which Philips product? A shaver, trimmer or toothbrush, a coffee machine or air fryer, a TV, or Hue bulbs?": "en/e4cc916472ce.m4a",
  "Which card? A gift card, the Fnac membership card, a memory card, Pokémon cards, or a graphics card?": "en/8bcb3b1384be.m4a",
  "Before you go: did you find what you were looking for?": "en/f43c4b966b38.m4a",
  "Thank you! Enjoy your visit.": "en/42cf2ce1e37d.m4a",
  "Thank you for telling us. A member of staff can help: tap “Call a staff member”.": "en/e908798a0816.m4a",
  "Accessibility mode: larger text and stronger contrast. If you can't use the stairs, there is a lift: tap “Call a staff member” and we'll take you there.": "en/60921771b9ca.m4a",
